**While Working As Technical Product Manager At MapmyIndia**

As a technical product manager with MapmyIndia, I had created a transport & shipment management system for our enterprise customers such as Tata steel, Mahindra logistics etc in order to reduce their transportation & pilferage cost.
This was built from scratch. I was involved with product vision, strategy, testing prototypes, and final delivery. This was a highly configurable system with easy integration with respective ERPs of our customers.
The impact was a reduction in transportation cost by > 30% and sale of 20k+ IoT devices generating a revenue of ~1.2 million USD.
